  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Long ago, a modest but prosperous ranch resided in a quiet spot in the
    West. Fertile soil full of luscious crops surrounded the vastness of the ranch.
    Once under the caring eyes of your grandfather, you find yourself in front of
    said \u2018prosperous\u2019 ranch. But in reality, it had been abandoned ever
    since your grandfather fell ill. For years, the ranch had fell dormant, wasting
    away in what is now an arid wasteland. With the recent passing of your grandfather,
    however, the ranch\u2019s responsibilities have been placed on your shoulders.
    Through hardwork and dedication, you will breathe new life into this decrepit
    ranch and restore its former glory just as did your grandfather."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
